y=10
width=479
height=69
layer=potions
textfont=museo_sans_11pt_regular
fontmono=no
text=...when consumed offer a 2% XP bonus in a random skill for yourself and a 1% XP bonus to others around you. These effects last for 5 minutes but can be extended for up to 30 minutes by drinking further love potions. You can have a love potion effect from yourself (2%) and someone else (1%) at the same time.
